      "writtenOn": "2015-04-21T08:33:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The logic is (as I understand it - I didn\u0027t invent this):\n\nif filtered_catalog is not empty then:\n  return filtered_catalog\nelse:\n if CONF.endpoint_filter_.return_all_endpoints_if_no_filter \u003d true then:\n    return unfiltered_catalog\n  else\n    return nothing\n\nso we need to prepare the filtered catalog - or at least determine that it will be empty no matter what.  We can\u0027t go round it.  Guang\u0027s idea in PS#12 to check the endpoint associations and the conf property first before preparing the filtered list might work.",
      "parentUuid": "dac4157f_0dde586d",
